{"nodes": [{"id": "build_css_p2_docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_object_literals_proto_and_null_prototype_proto_colon", "label": "__proto__ colon form", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/object-literals/proto-and-null-prototype.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Dedicated creation-time syntax that sets [[Prototype]] and creates no property. Shorthand {__proto__} and computed {[\"__proto__\"]:v} are ordinary properties. Non-object/non-null x is a silent no-op."}, {"id": "build_css_p2_docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_object_literals_proto_and_null_prototype_object_create_null", "label": "Object.create(null) dictionary", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/object-literals/proto-and-null-prototype.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "No inherited keys and no __proto__ accessor to pollute. Cost: no toString/hasOwnProperty \u2014 string conversion throws; existence checks need Object.hasOwn. Prefer Map unless a plain-object shape is required."}, {"id": "build_css_p2_docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_object_literals_proto_and_null_prototype_prototype_pollution", "label": "Prototype pollution", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/object-literals/proto-and-null-prototype.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "JSON.parse is not the hole \u2014 \"__proto__\" is a normal own key in JSON. Recursive merge that assigns target[\"__proto__\"] hits Object.prototype's accessor and pollutes every object, including ones created earlier."}], "edges": [{"source": "build_css_p2_docs_ja